## Input

```css
@mixin button($selector: ".dynamic") {
$color:red; color:$color;
/* typography */ font: {size:12px; weight:bold;}
.child {display:block} &:hover {color:blue}
#{$selector} { .nested {color:red} }
from {opacity:0} to {opacity:1}
}
.after {color:red}

